{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_title", "source_sha256": "327d1e1bfa094d0f274b7a83ac3b7f08a2ee90fc8baedad612fa623a5144b08d", "ja": "美希とおでかけ1", "zh": "和美希外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "16888ddc21c16a291374a052ff5a2942d74e92926c4418288c62601780808dd2", "ja": "美希とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和美希外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "30413ac5d6deb3b94660fa83936193caa9e4d91ad9aa87ddbfe784513e7292f2", "ja": "（三重県のラジオでのお仕事、美希はとても上手く\nやってくれた。旅先での経験は尊いものだな……）", "zh": "（这是美希在三重县广播电台工作的片段。美希表现得非常出色。旅途中的经历真是弥足珍贵啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "d193627fa49233137edea21c21c460120f73018624730d9029f87b8c45b8f6c8", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまなの。\nミキのトーク、どうだった？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦。\n美希的谈话，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "38b266db6dca817f2e30fbcd97c8f746eef6cd2bf76565901bb6abb7a5121210", "ja": "ああ、良かったよ。特に三重県の名産についていろいろ\n話していたところとか、地元の人も喜んでくれそうだ。", "zh": "啊，很不错。尤其是聊到三重县特产的那段，当地人应该也会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "e0050488f3264827d6ce67f790cd9eccf8bee321f67fb26b2af75c6c1e6ef1dd", "ja": "ほんと？　よかったの！\nじゃあ、ご褒美ちょうだい？", "zh": "真的吗？那太好了！\n那么，给我奖励好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "93eed10f9fa45188f36aa2854f33875697e5a00311cc7250aa9f73779bcad9f0", "ja": "ええっ、ご褒美？　うーん……何が欲しいんだ？", "zh": "诶诶，奖励？嗯……你想要什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "fd53a820bcf31da7ae7243a6fcfc4d6ae37a9961e4e0fbb68a90abc4da1a86cd", "ja": "当てて？　ヒントは……\nさっきの、ミキのトークにあるの！", "zh": "你猜猜看？提示就是……\n藏在美希刚才说的话里哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "afe22fe5dd6be3121dff4c9766796fa4b7cc9b1ccfb6c9edaef17b60d8b047fc", "ja": "……あっ！　わかった、真珠だな？　伊勢志摩の\n真珠が、すごく綺麗だったって言ってたし……。", "zh": "……啊！我知道了，是珍珠对吧？因为你刚才\n说过伊势志摩的珍珠特别漂亮……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "68ff4e9a871161adf60eb3536635662efff1f22b6f385549f57b1a1594eeaa17", "ja": "せーかいなのっ！　えへへ。ミキのこと\nちゃんとわかっててくれて嬉しいの、ハニー☆", "zh": "答对啦！嘿嘿。能好好理解美希，我很开心哦，亲爱的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4426e846f78a788673e5328d075c05f187bc06d34bcc96b333a79165ef2e3d94", "ja": "まあそれくらいはな……って、真珠か。\nあまり高価じゃないやつにしてくれよ？", "zh": "这点事我还是知道的……等等，珍珠吗？\n挑个别太贵的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "a9a954b02429fa0d7ea45e0e33fa16c76e22623c68d33193cd2571905b5b0b4a", "ja": "はーい、なの。バロックパールならそんなに\n高くないから、心配しなくていーよ！　それに……。", "zh": "好啦。巴洛克珍珠没那么贵，所以不用担心哦！而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "c1e136654d078684bea7e5ac4348564639275294c8d026f79da65a43ae716dd4", "ja": "{$P$}が\n買ってくれるなら、ミキ、どんな真珠でも嬉しいの☆", "zh": "只要{$P$}买给美希，\n不管是什么珍珠，美希都会开心的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "46fc4771d763a5def39bd0a51870e73a898ab48485c515be23f21fa04b1c6a4f", "ja": "そうか。それなら良かった。じゃあ、\n早速買いに行こう！　貝だけに。ははは！", "zh": "这样啊。那就好。我们马上去买吧！毕竟是贝壳嘛。哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7f7edf4b0ca10ff0cdd6b52f48e26b592e65a8779e6dcd2f3a66247b649148fb", "ja": "（あっ、流れで変なギャグを言ったら、冷たい目で\n見られてしまった。買い物で、挽回できるかな……）", "zh": "（啊，一时顺着气氛说了个奇怪的冷笑话，结果被人用冰冷的眼神盯着了。靠买东西能挽回局面吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
